  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced shallots and cook until they are caramelized and golden brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the blueberries, balsamic vinegar, and honey, and cook for 5 minutes, until the blueberries are caramelized and the sauce is thickened.",
    "Stir in the dried thyme, salt, pepper, and turmeric.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes, until the flavors are combined and the sauce is syrupy.",
    "Serve the skillet hot, garnished with fresh thyme if desired."
